= Aftershocks from Dornwich

[? if saxony_collectivist: A <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivist</span>-led government in Dornwich has done what a hundred pamphlets could not. It has made the propertied classes afraid. The great papers speak of little else. Deposits are moved quietly to Vera, the Major Guilds convene emergency councils, and in a thousand parlours the same conclusion is reached, that the republic's ordinary parties have failed to hold the line. The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> are the beneficiaries of that fear, and their support among the propertied classes rises. Support for the republic falls, and President DuFour makes no secret of his displeasure. ?]

[? if saxony_royalist_maj: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> now govern a state of the Commonwealth outright, and the whole country has taken note. What was an electoral abstraction is now an administration, with police, schools, and courts in Sovereigntist hands. In the workers' quarters the lesson lands hard. Men who never marched before are asking where the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> Banners sign their rolls, and Banner strength rises sharply. So does the sense that the hour is later than anyone wished to believe, and support for the republic falls. ?]
